@host = http://localhost:5121

### 1. Get test token (Development only; credentials test/test)
# @name login
POST {{host}}/api/auth/token
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": "test", "password": "test" }

###
@token = {{login.response.body.accessToken}}

### 2. Lookups
GET {{host}}/api/damage-types
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
GET {{host}}/api/damage-causes
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 3. Create claim (multipart)
# @name create
POST {{host}}/api/claims
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=b

--b
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="damageTypeId"

1
--b
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="damageCauseId"

2
--b
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="summary"

Tree fell on the car during the storm.
--b--

### 4. Get claim
GET {{host}}/api/claims/{{create.response.body.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
